  Turing.MultiTapeTM.spaceUsed cfg t = ∑ i, Turing.MultiTapeTM.spaceUsedByTape cfg t i
@Turing.MultiTapeTM.spaceUsed_le_of_abs_le : ∀ {k : ℕ} {Symbol : Type u_1} {State : Type u_2} {input : List Symbol}
